  "content_html": "<h1>bird wing</h1>\n<p class=\"momentDate\">2023</p>\n<div data-docs-catalogue-ref=\"c1\"><figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--full-column\" data-docs-content-detail=\"media\" data-docs-media-kind=\"catalogue-work\" data-docs-media-id=\"05200\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"docsViewer__mediaImageLink docsViewerFigure__imageLink\" data-docs-media-open aria-label=\"Open bird wing\"><img data-docs-media-image src=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/05200-primary-800.webp?v=1\" srcset=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/05200-primary-800.webp?v=1 800w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/05200-primary-1200.webp?v=1 1200w, https://media.dotlineform.com/works/img/05200-primary-1600.webp?v=1 1600w\" sizes=\"100vw\" alt=\"bird wing\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1282\" decoding=\"async\"><span data-docs-media-placeholder hidden>bird wing</span></button></figure></div>\n<pre class=\"moment-text\">\nwhen our codes become disassembled\nlike dripping water from a tap\nwhere do we end up?\n<p>conscious of the unraveling\nbut at same time\nnot knowing what is happening</p>\n<p>as if we were within a frame\nbut the frame isn’t there anymore</p>\n<p>in front of failing eyes\nand all memories are a blur</p>\n<p>every new memory dissolves\nleaving only a bird wing\n</pre></p>\n",
